{
  "note": "Content-type recipes for reels cut from podcast episodes (and, in `motion`, for motion videos built from an episode window's audio: beats, scene types, pacing, reveal, easing, transitions, theme, captions, SFX). The episode-analyst assigns a type per candidate; the reel then follows its recipe (pacing and limits are applied by the engine, the rest guides story-editor and publish-writer). A client profile may override any value (recipes.json in the profile). SFX kinds must be ones the engine can synthesise: whoosh, whoosh_soft, riser_soft, flash, pop, click, tick, hit_soft, shimmer.",
